  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAccounts Production\n\t\tAccounts Production Help Guide\n\n### Profit and Loss Appropriation Account\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at 10:24 AM\n\n\t\tLocation : Accounts Production >> Partnership Accounts >> Settings>>Business Contacts\n\nRefer to the Link\n\nWhile adding the Partner(s) information under business contacts, you can also update the details on areas such as - Share %, Salary, Interest On Capital and Interest On Drawings.\n\nOnce you update the relevant details, you will see them under the Profit and Loss Appropriation account in the accounts report as below.\n\nPlease refer below video for more information.\n\nClick here to watch a video on the Profit and Loss Appropriation Account\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115345\">Accounts Production</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188540\">Accounts Production Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Profit and Loss Appropriation Account\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at 10:24 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Location : Accounts Production &gt;&gt; Partnership Accounts &gt;&gt; Settings&gt;&gt;Business Contacts<br><br><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/accounts/settings/report/contact.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Refer to the Link</a><br><br>While adding the Partner(s) information under business contacts, you can also update the details on areas such as - Share %, Salary, Interest On Capital and Interest On Drawings.<br><br><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074113343/original/lU_sKtyJLWdOT_DOIhYmzVS-HdLP4BCLZQ.png?1553509329\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074113343/original/lU_sKtyJLWdOT_DOIhYmzVS-HdLP4BCLZQ.png?1553509329\" data-fileid=\"9074113343\" data-uniquekey=\"1553509316132\">Once you update the relevant details, you will see them under the Profit and Loss Appropriation account in the accounts report as below.<br><br><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074113344/original/uY8eI6KMMp98g9D8KPvtYj5-xo1S6_Oj_Q.png?1553509329\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074113344/original/uY8eI6KMMp98g9D8KPvtYj5-xo1S6_Oj_Q.png?1553509329\" data-fileid=\"9074113344\" data-uniquekey=\"1553509316132\"></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please refer below video for more information.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/35561c616bee46a4b18f8f62da40012e\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Click here to watch a video on the Profit and Loss Appropriation Account</strong></a><br><br></span><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165503\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165503/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165503\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165503/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165503\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\